<html>
	<head>
		<title>Fruits</title>
	</head>
	<body style="background-color: #f9ffe6;">
		<h1 style=" text-align: center; color: #d32f2f; font-style: italic; ">FRUITS</h1>
		
		<p style="color: darkgreen; font-size: 18px; font-style:italic; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; padding: 12;">
			Fruits are nature’s sweet and nutritious gifts, packed with vitamins, minerals, and fiber that help keep our bodies healthy.<br>
			They come in a wide variety of colors, flavors, and textures—from the juicy sweetness of mangoes and oranges to the crisp freshness of apples and pears.<br>
			Eating a variety of fruits every day can boost the immune system, improve digestion, and provide natural energy.<br>
			Whether enjoyed fresh, blended into smoothies, or added to salads and desserts, fruits are an essential part of a balanced diet and a delicious way to stay healthy.
		</p>
		
		<ul>
			<li style="color:red">APPLE</li>
			<li style="color:orange">ORENGE</li>
			<li style="color:lime">BANANA</li>
			<li style="color:purple">grapes</li>
			etc...
		</ul>
			

